-- the keys of the sort do not share one direction
Code: 48. The accumulator '$first' after a '$sort' whose keys do not share one direction is not supported
Code: 48. The accumulator '$push' after a '$sort' whose keys do not share one direction is not supported
-- a stage in between builds documents that do not have the sort key
Code: 48. The accumulator '$first' reads the documents of the group in the order of the stream, and the keys the preceding '$sort' established are not fields of the documents the '$group' reads: sort right before the '$group', or keep the sort keys
-- an accumulator that does not depend on the order is unaffected
a	3
b	2
-- and so is a group that no sort precedes
a	3
b	2
